{"logId": "0d77ea76-86b4-46ed-ab23-2eb8a396c448", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "“远离毒品”四大招", "block_bbox": [217, 191, 410, 220], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 191.0], [410.0, 191.0], [410.0, 220.0], [217.0, 220.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、少去娱乐场所，拒绝陌生人赠送的香烟或饮料。", "block_bbox": [191, 272, 634, 299], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 272.0], [634.0, 272.0], [634.0, 299.0], [191.0, 299.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、尽量不要结识有不良习惯的人群。", "block_bbox": [191, 309, 516, 336], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 309.0], [516.0, 309.0], [516.0, 336.0], [191.0, 336.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、对任何形式的毒品要时刻保持警惕，不要抱着猎奇的心态，去尝一尝，试一试，希望从中体验不一样的刺激。", "block_bbox": [192, 345, 645, 421], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[192.0, 345.0], [645.0, 345.0], [645.0, 421.0], [192.0, 421.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不小心沾染上毒品，要立即去戒毒所寻求帮助。", "block_bbox": [191, 430, 634, 458], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[191.0, 430.0], [634.0, 430.0], [634.0, 458.0], [191.0, 458.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [689, 186, 961, 365], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[689.0, 186.0], [961.0, 186.0], [961.0, 365.0], [689.0, 365.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [690, 395, 960, 559], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[690.0, 395.0], [960.0, 395.0], [960.0, 559.0], [690.0, 559.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 594, 1122, 641], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 594.0], [1122.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "生活篇--外出安全", "block_bbox": [93, 679, 309, 712], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[93.0, 679.0], [309.0, 679.0], [309.0, 712.0], [93.0, 712.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 767, 191, 802], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 767.0], [191.0, 767.0], [191.0, 802.0], [121.0, 802.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "六、休假期间外出的安全注意事项", "block_bbox": [114, 832, 456, 863], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[114.0, 832.0], [456.0, 832.0], [456.0, 863.0], [114.0, 863.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、行前预先规划旅游路线，充分了解交通路况；", "block_bbox": [167, 904, 596, 932], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[167.0, 904.0], [596.0, 904.0], [596.0, 932.0], [167.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、勤汇报行程：", "block_bbox": [166, 950, 322, 977], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 950.0], [322.0, 950.0], [322.0, 977.0], [166.0, 977.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、建议现金均分2份分开存放；", "block_bbox": [167, 996, 450, 1023], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[167.0, 996.0], [450.0, 996.0], [450.0, 1023.0], [167.0, 1023.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、注意自身旅游安全，勿擅自到未开放的旅游山区和危险山区游玩；注意并依照警告、禁止标志的规定进行旅游；", "block_bbox": [166, 1042, 741, 1104], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 1042.0], [741.0, 1042.0], [741.0, 1104.0], [166.0, 1104.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、防人之心不可缺少。一些不法分子会利用“老乡”、“同行”等借口主动搭讪，或主动赠送食品及物品，在你放松警惕时实施诈骗和盗窃；", "block_bbox": [166, 1122, 749, 1216], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 1122.0], [749.0, 1122.0], [749.0, 1216.0], [166.0, 1216.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、爱护自然环境，不破坏景观资源；维护风景区环境整洁，不任意丢弃垃圾。", "block_bbox": [166, 1235, 742, 1295], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 1235.0], [742.0, 1235.0], [742.0, 1295.0], [166.0, 1295.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [784, 856, 999, 977], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[784.0, 856.0], [999.0, 856.0], [999.0, 977.0], [784.0, 977.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [786, 998, 996, 1126], "block_id": 18, "block_order": null, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[786.0, 998.0], [996.0, 998.0], [996.0, 1126.0], [786.0, 1126.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [786, 1139, 994, 1263], "block_id": 19, "block_order": null, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[786.0, 1139.0], [994.0, 1139.0], [994.0, 1263.0], [786.0, 1263.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1273, 1123, 1314], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1273.0], [1123.0, 1273.0], [1123.0, 1314.0], [939.0, 1314.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8734867572784424, "coordinate": [217, 191, 410, 220], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[217.0, 191.0], [410.0, 191.0], [410.0, 220.0], [217.0, 220.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8497284650802612, "coordinate": [191, 27